# 3D digital twin

- `FacilityCanvas` loads only via the client wrapper `twin-loader.tsx` with `next/dynamic(..., { ssr: false })`.
- `InstancedMesh` for repeated racks/pallets; memoize geometry/materials.
- Per-frame camera/animation state in refs + `useFrame`, **never** `useState`.
- Dispose owned geometries, materials, textures on unmount.
- Scene and selection details come from data (`FacilityScene`) — no hardcoded demo strings or positions.
- Heatmap colors from server-normalized values; missing samples get a distinct no-data color, never the zero/healthy color.

Full guidance: `.cursor/skills/facilityiq-3d-digital-twin/SKILL.md`.
